        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Santa's Sensational Christmas Wonderland Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Springfield's magical Christmas Wonderland. Help Santa and his Elves in his new house and North Pole Workshops. Fly in his fabulous supersonic Sleigh. Visit Santa's stunning 'Ice Palace' Grotto. Win an amazing Mystery tour on Santa's Wonderland Express at the North Pole. Take part in Springfield's sensational Christmas Parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your very own Christmas Wonderland Neighborhood. Win lots of Rewards &amp; Achievements. Search for Frosty the Snowman. Take Pictures, make an Album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Toys are made and it's Christmas Eve! Rudolph &amp; the team are all hitched up to the Sleigh. Santa flies up into Outer Space and around the World while all the Kids are asleep, or are they? ... soon it's another wonderful Christmas Morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa find Hidden Objects, Lost Presents, Golden Angels. Play superb Mini-Games. Earn Merit Badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Wonderland 16 is crammed full of Presents &amp; Hidden Surprises with Gorgeous Graphics and Puzzles. Choose from Game Modes to suit every player - Beginner, Intermediate, through to Expert. Join in the fun, with Captivating Christmas gameplay for Families and Friends of All Ages &amp; Abilities to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mystery Tour of Wonderland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride Santa's Wonderland Express.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Extreme mode for Experts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Locations, Graphics &amp; Gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Collection of Bonus Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Wallpapers &amp; Music Player.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Santa's Sensational Christmas Wonderland Adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Springfield's magical Christmas Wonderland. Help Santa and his Elves in his new house and North Pole Workshops. Fly in his fabulous supersonic Sleigh. Visit Santa's stunning 'Ice Palace' Grotto. Win an amazing Mystery tour on Santa's Wonderland Express at the North Pole. Take part in Springfield's sensational Christmas Parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your very own Christmas Wonderland Neighborhood. Win lots of Rewards &amp; Achievements. Search for Frosty the Snowman. Take Pictures, make an Album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Toys are made and it's Christmas Eve! Rudolph &amp; the team are all hitched up to the Sleigh. Santa flies up into Outer Space and around the World while all the Kids are asleep, or are they? ... soon it's another wonderful Christmas Morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa find Hidden Objects, Lost Presents, Golden Angels. Play superb Mini-Games. Earn Merit Badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Wonderland 16 is crammed full of Presents &amp; Hidden Surprises with Gorgeous Graphics and Puzzles. Choose from Game Modes to suit every player - Beginner, Intermediate, through to Expert. Join in the fun, with Captivating Christmas gameplay for Families and Friends of All Ages &amp; Abilities to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mystery Tour of Wonderland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride Santa's Wonderland Express.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Extreme mode for Experts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Locations, Graphics &amp; Gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Collection of Bonus Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Wallpapers &amp; Music Player.</p></li></ul>",
